{"help": "https://open.canada.ca/data/api/3/action/help_show?name=package_show", "success": true, "result": {"association_type": [], "audience": [], "author": null, "author_email": null, "collection": "primary", "contributor": {"en": "", "fr": ""}, "creator": "", "creator_user_id": "aa584ab4-544c-4c5c-81da-d1cff9bd96fa", "data_series_issue_identification": {"en": "", "fr": ""}, "data_series_name": {"en": "", "fr": ""}, "date_modified": "2026-01-30 00:00:00", "date_published": "2013-10-16 00:00:00", "digital_object_identifier": "", "display_flags": [], "frequency": "as_needed", "geographic_region": [], "id": "98f1a129-f628-4ce4-b24d-6f16bf24dd64", "imso_approval": "true", "isopen": false, "jurisdiction": "federal", "keywords": {"en": ["Energy Efficiency", "Cars", "Light Trucks", "Buying", "Fuel Consumption", "fuel economy"], "fr": ["efficacit\u00e9 \u00e9nerg\u00e9tique", "V\u00e9hicules", "camions l\u00e9gers", "Achats", "consommation de carburant", "economie d'essence"]}, "license_id": "ca-ogl-lgo", "license_title": "Open Government Licence - Canada", "license_url": "https://open.canada.ca/en/open-government-licence-canada", "maintainer": null, "maintainer_email": "", "metadata_created": "2017-03-31T13:40:16.424479", "metadata_modified": "2026-10-04T15:25:52.241154", "name": "98f1a129-f628-4ce4-b24d-6f16bf24dd64", "notes": "Data sets provide model-specific fuel consumption ratings and estimated carbon dioxide emissions for new light-duty vehicles for retail sale in Canada.\r\n\r\nTo help you compare vehicles from different model years, the fuel consumption ratings for 1995 to 2014 vehicles have been adjusted to reflect 5-cycle testing. Note that these are approximate values that were generated from the original ratings, not from vehicle testing.\r\n\r\nFor more information on fuel consumption testing, visit: https://natural-resources.canada.ca/energy-efficiency/transportation-energy-efficiency/fuel-consumption-testing.\r\n\r\nTo compare the fuel consumption information of new and older models to find the most fuel-efficient vehicle that meets your everyday needs, use the fuel consumption ratings search tool at https://fcr-ccc.nrcan-rncan.gc.ca/en/Search.\r\n\r\n(Data update: September 29, 2026)\r\n", "notes_translated": {"en": "Data sets provide model-specific fuel consumption ratings and estimated carbon dioxide emissions for new light-duty vehicles for retail sale in Canada.\r\n\r\nTo help you compare vehicles from different model years, the fuel consumption ratings for 1995 to 2014 vehicles have been adjusted to reflect 5-cycle testing. Note that these are approximate values that were generated from the original ratings, not from vehicle testing.\r\n\r\nFor more information on fuel consumption testing, visit: https://natural-resources.canada.ca/energy-efficiency/transportation-energy-efficiency/fuel-consumption-testing.\r\n\r\nTo compare the fuel consumption information of new and older models to find the most fuel-efficient vehicle that meets your everyday needs, use the fuel consumption ratings search tool at https://fcr-ccc.nrcan-rncan.gc.ca/en/Search.\r\n\r\n(Data update: September 29, 2026)\r\n", "fr": "Les ensembles de donn\u00e9es fournissent les cotes de consommation de carburant et les estimations d\u2019\u00e9missions de dioxyde de carbone propres \u00e0 chacun des mod\u00e8les de v\u00e9hicules l\u00e9gers neufs vendus au d\u00e9tail au Canada.\r\n\r\nAfin de vous aider \u00e0 comparer les v\u00e9hicules de differentes ann\u00e9es mod\u00e8les, les cotes de consommation de carburant pour les v\u00e9hicules de 1995 \u00e0 2014 ont \u00e9t\u00e9 ajust\u00e9es pour correspondre \u00e0 la proc\u00e9dure d'essai \u00e0 cinq cycles. Il convient de noter que ces valeurs sont approximatives et qu\u2019elles ont \u00e9t\u00e9 produites \u00e0 partir des cotes originales; elles n\u2019ont pas \u00e9t\u00e9 obtenues \u00e0 la suite d\u2019essais des v\u00e9hicules.\r\n\r\nPour en apprendre davantage sur les essais sur la consommation de carburant, consultez : https://ressources-naturelles.canada.ca/efficacite-energetique/efficacite-energetique-transports/essais-consommation-carburant.\r\n\r\nPour comparer l'information relative \u00e0 la consommation de carburant de nouveaux et plus anciens mod\u00e8les pour trouver le v\u00e9hicule le plus \u00e9co\u00e9nerg\u00e9tique qui saura r\u00e9pondre \u00e0 vos besoins quotidiens, utilisez l\u2019outil de recherche pour les cotes de consommation de carburant \u00e0 l\u2019adresse https://fcr-ccc.nrcan-rncan.gc.ca/fr/Search.\r\n\r\n(Donn\u00e9es mises \u00e0 jour : 29 septembre 2026)"}, "num_resources": 16, "num_tags": 0, "org_section": {"en": "", "fr": ""}, "org_title_at_publication": {"en": "Natural Resources Canada", "fr": "Ressources naturelles Canada"}, "organization": {"id": "9391E0A2-9717-4755-B548-4499C21F917B", "name": "nrcan-rncan", "title": "Natural Resources Canada | Ressources naturelles Canada", "type": "organization", "description": "", "image_url": "", "created": "2016-09-23T17:25:46.737130", "is_organization": true, "approval_status": "approved", "state": "active"}, "owner_org": "9391E0A2-9717-4755-B548-4499C21F917B", "place_of_publication": [], "portal_release_date": "2017-03-31", "private": false, "program_page_url": {"en": "", "fr": ""}, "ready_to_publish": "true", "restrictions": "unrestricted", "spatial": "", "spatial_representation_type": [], "state": "active", "subject": ["economics_and_industry", "nature_and_environment", "science_and_technology", "transport"], "time_period_coverage_end": "2026-12-31 00:00:00", "time_period_coverage_start": "1995-01-01 00:00:00", "title": "Fuel consumption ratings", "title_translated": {"en": "Fuel consumption ratings", "fr": "Cotes de consommation de carburant"}, "topic_category": [], "type": "dataset", "url": null, "version": null, "resources": [{"cache_last_updated": null, "cache_url": null, "character_set": "", "created": "2024-01-19T16:11:30.737812", "data_quality": [], "datasto